Package: zuproto
Title: Protocol Buffers Decoding and Encoding with 'upb'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", , "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Decodes and encodes Protocol Buffers messages from
    descriptor sets rather than generated code. One message becomes a
    named list; many messages become a data frame built column by
    column. Uses a bundled copy of the 'upb' runtime
    (<https://github.com/protocolbuffers/protobuf>), so no system
    'protobuf' library or 'protoc' compiler is required.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/pedrobtz/zuproto,
    https://pedrobtz.github.io/zuproto/
BugReports: https://github.com/pedrobtz/zuproto/issues
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1)
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-GB
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
